1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,440
Preset scan modes are predefined collections of scan settings. They offer a quick way to

2
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:16,560
adjust how the scan balances speed and coverage. To select a preset scan mode, just navigate

3
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:23,080
to your sites page, select a site you want to edit, click the details tab and select

4
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:33,140
edit. We scroll down to our scan settings section, scan configuration is selected by default. Ensure

5
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:39,480
that you have the use a preset scan mode selected and then we can click one of the available options.

6
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:47,680
Lightweight is the fastest scan mode with scans capped at 15 minutes in length. It is useful in

7
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:54,240
situations where you need fast feedback on a target. Fast is intended to give you a general

8
00:00:54,240 --> 00:01:01,720
overview of a site's security posture quickly. Balanced is useful for general purpose scanning.

9
00:01:01,720 --> 00:01:09,340
It is designed to give a good balance between coverage and speed. And finally, Deep is intended

10
00:01:09,340 --> 00:01:14,800
to give you an in-depth look at a site's security posture. The time taken to run a scan using the

11
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:21,600
Deep configuration depends heavily on the site's size and complexity. Please note you can only select

12
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:26,880
one preset scan mode for a site. If you want to combine different configurations together on a

13
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:34,000
single site, you should use a custom configuration instead. We also recommend keeping a consistent scan

14
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:39,920
configuration for each site that you add. Changing the scan configuration can affect vulnerability trends

15
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:45,200
over time and cause BIPs with Enterprise Edition to give inaccurate time estimates while scanning.

16
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:50,080
If you want to scan a site you have already added with a new configuration,

17
00:01:50,080 --> 00:02:04,720
we recommend adding the site again with the new configuration selected. Thank you.

